{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1TI","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"提摩太前书","commonName":"提摩太前书","title":"提摩太前书","order":54,"numberOfChapters":6,"sha256":"456677ee5f530a55036c148b493beeb4550b2d03494fe29181083852bcdd0746","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":6,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/6.json","totalNumberOfVerses":113},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["监督与执事的资格"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["“人若渴望做教会的监督，就是在爱慕尊贵的工作。”这句话千真万确。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["做监督的人必须无可指责，只有一位妻子，为人节制自律、受人尊敬、乐于接待客旅、善于教导、"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["待人温和，不酗酒、不好斗、不争吵、不贪财，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["善于管理自己的家，受儿女的敬重和孝顺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["一个人要是不懂得管理自己的家，又怎能照顾上帝的教会呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["初信主的人不可做监督，免得他自高自大，遭受魔鬼所受的惩罚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["做监督的在教会以外也必须有好名声，以免被人指责，陷入魔鬼的圈套。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["同样，做执事的也要品行端正，说话诚实，不好酒，不贪财，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要存着清洁的良心持守奥妙的真道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他们要先接受考验，倘若无可指责，就可以立他们为执事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["执事的妻子",{"noteId":1},"也要品行端正，不搬弄是非，为人节制，做事忠心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["执事只能有一位妻子，他要管好自己的儿女和自己的家。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["尽忠职守的执事能得到好声誉，也会对基督耶稣有坚定的信心。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["奥妙无比的信仰"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我希望能尽快去你那里，但还是先写信告诉你这些事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["这样，如果我行期延误，你也可以知道在上帝的家中该怎么做。这家是永活上帝的教会，是真理的柱石和根基。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["毫无疑问，我们伟大的信仰奥妙无比：",{"text":"祂以肉身显现，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被圣灵证明为义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被天使看见，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被传扬到列邦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被世人信奉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被接到天上的荣耀中。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“执事的妻子”或译“女执事”。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}